<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>Imnandi NovaCare Medical Center</title>

    <link rel="stylesheet"
          href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.2/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css">

    <link rel="stylesheet"
          href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.0/css/all.min.css">

    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        html,
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #f5f7fb;
            color: #1f2937;
        }

        body {
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        .sidebar {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 250px;
            height: 100vh;
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #0b3d62 0%, #082c47 100%);
            padding: 35px 22px;
            z-index: 1000;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        .sidebar-title {
            color: #ffffff;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 23px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 45px;
            padding-left: 10px;
        }

            .sidebar-title:hover {
                color: #ffffff;
            }

        .nav {
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .nav-link {
            color: rgba(255,255,255,.78);
            padding: 13px 15px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: all .25s ease;
        }

            .nav-link:hover {
                color: #ffffff;
                background: rgba(255,255,255,.12);
                transform: translateX(4px);
            }

        .social-icons {
            margin-top: auto;
            display: flex;
            gap: 15px;
            padding-left: 10px;
        }

            .social-icons a {
                width: 38px;
                height: 38px;
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
                color: #ffffff;
                background: rgba(255,255,255,.1);
                border-radius: 50%;
                text-decoration: none;
                transition: .25s ease;
            }

                .social-icons a:hover {
                    background: #0d6efd;
                    transform: translateY(-3px);
                }

        .main-content {
            margin-left: 250px;
        }

        section {
            position: relative;
            min-height: 100vh;
            overflow: hidden;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .home-bg-wrapper {
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .home-bg {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
            display: block;
            filter: brightness(.55);
            transition: transform 1s ease;
        }

        section:hover .home-bg {
            transform: scale(1.03);
        }

        .home-card,
        .text-card {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
            width: min(850px, 90%);
            padding: 55px;
            border-radius: 24px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,.94);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.2);
            backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
        }

        .home-card {
            text-align: center;
        }

            .home-card h1 {
                font-size: clamp(35px, 5vw, 60px);
                font-weight: 800;
                color: #0b3d62;
                margin-bottom: 20px;
            }

            .home-card p {
                font-size: 19px;
                color: #5b6470;
                line-height: 1.7;
                margin-bottom: 30px;
            }

        .home-card-buttons {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 15px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

            .home-card-buttons .btn {
                padding: 12px 25px;
                border-radius: 10px;
                font-weight: 600;
            }

        .text-card h2 {
            color: #0b3d62;
            font-size: 34px;
            font-weight: 750;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .text-card p {
            color: #4b5563;
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.8;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .chatbot-button {
            position: fixed;
            right: 28px;
            bottom: 28px;
            width: 62px;
            height: 62px;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #0d6efd;
            color: #ffffff;
            font-size: 25px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(13,110,253,.35);
            cursor: pointer;
            z-index: 2000;
            transition: .25s ease;
        }

            .chatbot-button:hover {
                transform: translateY(-4px) scale(1.04);
                background: #0b5ed7;
            }

        .chatbot-window {
            position: fixed;
            right: 28px;
            bottom: 105px;
            width: 370px;
            max-width: calc(100vw - 35px);
            height: 560px;
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.2);
            z-index: 1999;
            display: none;
            flex-direction: column;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
        }

            .chatbot-window.active {
                display: flex;
            }

        .chatbot-header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0b3d62, #0d6efd);
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 18px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }

        .chatbot-header-left {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .chatbot-avatar {
            width: 42px;
            height: 42px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,.18);
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 18px;
        }

        .chatbot-header h5 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .chatbot-header small {
            opacity: .8;
        }

        .chatbot-close {
            border: none;
            background: transparent;
            color: #ffffff;
            font-size: 20px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .chatbot-messages {
            flex: 1;
            padding: 18px;
            overflow-y: auto;
            background: #f8fafc;
        }

        .chat-message {
            display: flex;
            margin-bottom: 13px;
        }

            .chat-message.bot {
                justify-content: flex-start;
            }

            .chat-message.user {
                justify-content: flex-end;
            }

        .message-bubble {
            max-width: 82%;
            padding: 11px 14px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .bot .message-bubble {
            background: #ffffff;
            color: #374151;
            border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            border-bottom-left-radius: 4px;
        }

        .user .message-bubble {
            background: #0d6efd;
            color: #ffffff;
            border-bottom-right-radius: 4px;
        }

        .quick-questions {
            padding: 12px 15px;
            background: #ffffff;
            border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
        }

        .quick-title {
            font-size: 11px;
            color: #6b7280;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .quick-buttons {
            display: flex;
            gap: 7px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .quick-btn {
            border: 1px solid #dbe3ec;
            background: #f8fafc;
            color: #374151;
            border-radius: 50px;
            padding: 6px 10px;
            font-size: 11px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: .2s ease;
        }

            .quick-btn:hover {
                background: #eaf2ff;
                border-color: #86b7fe;
                color: #0d6efd;
            }

        .chatbot-input-area {
            padding: 12px;
            border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            background: #ffffff;
            display: flex;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .chatbot-input {
            flex: 1;
            border: 1px solid #d9dee7;
            border-radius: 50px;
            padding: 10px 15px;
            outline: none;
            font-size: 13px;
        }

            .chatbot-input:focus {
                border-color: #86b7fe;
                box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(13,110,253,.08);
            }

        .chatbot-send {
            width: 42px;
            height: 42px;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #0d6efd;
            color: #ffffff;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .typing {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 4px;
        }

            .typing span {
                width: 6px;
                height: 6px;
                background: #9ca3af;
                border-radius: 50%;
                display: inline-block;
                animation: typingAnimation 1.4s infinite ease-in-out;
            }

                .typing span:nth-child(2) {
                    animation-delay: .2s;
                }

                .typing span:nth-child(3) {
                    animation-delay: .4s;
                }

        @@keyframes typingAnimation {
            0%, 60%, 100% {
                transform: translateY(0);
                opacity: .5;
            }

            30% {
                transform: translateY(-5px);
                opacity: 1;
            }
        }

        @@media (max-width: 900px) {
            .sidebar {
                width: 200px;
            }

            .main-content {
                margin-left: 200px;
            }

            .sidebar-title {
                font-size: 19px;
            }

            .home-card,
            .text-card {
                padding: 35px;
            }
        }

        @@media (max-width: 700px) {
            .sidebar {
                position: relative;
                width: 100%;
                height: auto;
                min-height: auto;
                padding: 18px;
            }

            .sidebar-title {
                margin-bottom: 15px;
            }

            .nav {
                flex-direction: row !important;
                flex-wrap: wrap;
            }

            .nav-link {
                padding: 8px 10px;
            }

            .social-icons {
                margin-top: 15px;
            }

            .main-content {
                margin-left: 0;
            }

            section {
                min-height: 700px;
            }

            .home-card,
            .text-card {
                padding: 28px;
            }

                .text-card h2 {
                    font-size: 28px;
                }

                .home-card p {
                    font-size: 16px;
                }
        }

        @@media (max-width: 500px) {
            .chatbot-window {
                right: 15px;
                bottom: 90px;
                width: calc(100vw - 30px);
                height: 520px;
            }

            .chatbot-button {
                right: 18px;
                bottom: 18px;
            }

            .home-card,
            .text-card {
                width: 92%;
                padding: 24px;
                border-radius: 18px;
            }

                .home-card h1 {
                    font-size: 34px;
                }

            .home-card-buttons {
                flex-direction: column;
            }

                .home-card-buttons .btn {
                    width: 100%;
                }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <nav class="sidebar">

        <a href="#home" class="sidebar-title">
            Imnandi NovaCare
        </a>

        <ul class="nav flex-column">

            <li class="nav-item">
                <a class="nav-link" href="#home">Home</a>
            </li>

            <li class="nav-item">
                <a class="nav-link" href="#about-us">About Us</a>
            </li>

            <li class="nav-item">
                <a class="nav-link" href="#careers">Careers</a>
            </li>

            <li class="nav-item">
                <a class="nav-link" href="#news">News Hub</a>
            </li>

            <li class="nav-item">
                <a class="nav-link" href="#investors">Investors</a>
            </li>

            <li class="nav-item">
                <a class="nav-link" href="#contact">Contact</a>
            </li>

        </ul>

        <div class="social-icons">

            <a href="https://facebook.com" target="_blank">
                <i class="fab fa-facebook"></i>
            </a>

            <a href="https://twitter.com" target="_blank">
                <i class="fab fa-twitter"></i>
            </a>

        </div>

    </nav>

    <div class="main-content">

        <section id="home">

            <div class="home-bg-wrapper">
                <img class="home-bg"
                     src="/images/homepage_pic.jpg"
                     alt="Hospital Image">
            </div>

            <div class="home-card">

                <h1>
                    Welcome to Imnandi NovaCare
                </h1>

                <p>
                    Providing world-class healthcare with compassion and innovation.
                </p>

                <div class="home-card-buttons">

                    <a href="#about-us"
                       class="btn btn-primary">
                        Read More
                    </a>

                    <a href="/Identity/Account/Login"
                       class="btn btn-secondary">
                        Login
                    </a>

                </div>

            </div>

        </section>

        <section id="about-us" class="section">

            <div class="home-bg-wrapper">
                <img class="home-bg"
                     src="/images/about_us.jpg"
                     alt="About Image">
            </div>

            <div class="text-card">

                <h2>About Us</h2>

                <p>
                    Imnandi NovaCare Medical Center has been serving the community
                    for over 25 years, offering exceptional patient care,
                    state-of-the-art facilities, and advanced medical treatments.
                    Our mission is to ensure every patient receives top-quality
                    healthcare with empathy and professionalism.
                </p>

                <p>
                    We pride ourselves on our multidisciplinary teams, innovative
                    research programs, and a patient-first approach that defines
                    our culture and standards.
                </p>

            </div>

        </section>

        <section id="careers" class="section">

            <div class="home-bg-wrapper">
                <img class="home-bg"
                     src="/images/careers.jpg"
                     alt="Careers Image">
            </div>

            <div class="text-card">

                <h2>Careers</h2>

                <p>
                    Join the Imnandi NovaCare team and help make a difference in
                    people’s lives. We offer opportunities for doctors, nurses,
                    medical technicians, administrative staff, and more.
                </p>

                <p>
                    We provide professional development, mentorship programs,
                    and a supportive work environment. Explore current openings
                    and submit your application online.
                </p>

            </div>

        </section>

        <section id="news" class="section">

            <div class="home-bg-wrapper">
                <img class="home-bg"
                     src="/images/news.jpg"
                     alt="NewsHub Image">
            </div>

            <div class="text-card">

                <h2>News Hub</h2>

                <p>
                    Stay updated with the latest medical news, breakthroughs,
                    hospital events, and community outreach initiatives.
                    Our News Hub covers innovations in healthcare, patient
